  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMO Tsunami - IMO/FAO Tsunami Joint Safety a</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IMO/FAO Tsunami Joint Safety at Sea 2007-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Is a joint IMO/FAO project and the result of provision of unsea-worthy small vessels offered by various internatinoal  organisations in the aftermath of the tsunami. Concerns support to improved design, construction and equipment as well as introcuction of appropriate standrads and the provision of advice onoperational safety in India and Sri Lanka.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc4;r ett gemensamt IMO/FAO projekt s tillkom efter tsunamin pga att olika internat. organiationer tillhandah&#xf6;ll odugliga sm&#xe5;b&#xe5;tar till drabbade fiskebyar. Avser st&#xf6;d till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad design, konstrukton o utrustning samt introduktion av l&#xe4;mpliga standrards o regler f&#xf6;r sj&#xf6;s&#xe4;kerhet f&#xf6;r nya och existerande b&#xe5;tar f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5;skaligt fiske i Indien och Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
